  "_comment": "Canonical mode catalog \u2014 the single source of truth for mode metadata across web/iOS/Android. Edit here, then run `pnpm gen:modes` to regenerate the native files (ModeCatalog.generated.swift / .kt), the web TS and the SQL era functions. Icons stay platform-native; only data lives here. Board/guess counts live in the engine, not here. Fields: group = home grid tile (core) or More Games sheet (more); sweep = counts toward the Daily Sweep / Flawless; engine = shared word reducer or the mode's own view; guessSemantics = what guess_count means for labels; guessBase = the perfect guess_count (display shows guess_count \u2212 guessBase); enabled = compiled in and visible; flagKey = remote kill switch; category = More Games sheet section; guideSlug = lib/guide-content.ts entry. Ids and dbKeys are generic and rename-proof \u2014 only title/shortTitle/shareLabel carry a brand.",
